    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain destruction down on your enemies. Gather their remains to fuel your rise to ultimate power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804420/extras/82f139f8a4e87f3f1340a9cd25d7026a.poster.avif?t=1749876732\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804420/extras/82f139f8a4e87f3f1340a9cd25d7026a.webm?t=1749876732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804420/extras/82f139f8a4e87f3f1340a9cd25d7026a.mp4?t=1749876732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat mighty Bosses to unlock new levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804420/extras/323f7b2b0be246964ada463085026288.poster.avif?t=1749876732\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804420/extras/323f7b2b0be246964ada463085026288.webm?t=1749876732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804420/extras/323f7b2b0be246964ada463085026288.mp4?t=1749876732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your path to ultimate power by unlocking new abilities in the Skill Tree.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804420/extras/40e265e7f8d7d1e2b76f77989fa97633.poster.avif?t=1749876732\